NegroniMetal changes to the ios-flame 745c434 Metal frontend (MIT):
- native_bridge_metal_set_surface_hook: the plugin is told each IOSurface's CPU range and ID before its import
  (Turnip's negroni_drm.c redwood_drm_note_surface imports the surface by ID: kernel 0230 has no user-page import).
- QuartzCore 20H392 selectors the frontend lacked (scripts/metal/selector-gap.py): MTLTexture swizzle/compression/
  sparse/shareable/parent-relative/rootResource/gpuResourceID answers, identity-swizzle views, makeAliasable,
  pipeline and sampler gpuResourceID/allocatedSize, MTLCommandQueue SPI -finish.

